## Interface: 16001
## OptionalDeps: ForeverHub
## Title: LevelLog
## Notes: Records logged-in time, deaths and XP from quests and from kills for each level, per character; a dated journey, lifetime stats, where your time goes and when you will level, and a summary of your last fights from the game's damage meter, in its own window.
